# help cards and the knobs (X0X's ways): a held button shows its card and then does nothing; SAVE
# held on goes back to the recipe; a few quick clicks are exact, a quick spin sweeps
wait 300
expect par0 50
press REC
wait 1000
shot help_rec.png
release REC
wait 200
expect frozen 0
tap REC
wait 200
expect frozen 1
tap REC
wait 200
expect frozen 0
tap HOME
turn SELECT 3
turn K1 3 10
expect par0 53
wait 500
turn K1 -3 30
expect par0 50
wait 500
turn K1 -12 10
expect par0 0
wait 500
turn K1 2 100
expect par0 2
wait 1500
press SAVE
wait 1000
shot help_save.png
wait 700
release SAVE
wait 200
expect par0 50
tap SEL
turn K2 1 80
wait 100
shot space_turning.png
# HOME + SELECT: the fade (0.8), from any page
press HOME
turn SELECT 3 100
release HOME
expect view 4
expect view 4
